  "_about": [
    "PCFD CAD vocabulary: everything the console offers as a list, in one file, read at startup.",
    "From the department's sheet \"[TEMPLATE] PCFD ECC OPS\" (export of 2026-10-07): codes, order, statuses and",
    "colors. Each item is {code, name}: the code is the sheet's (stored, matched, exported to CSV), the name is",
    "what the console shows. A plain string is also accepted (code = name). Keys starting with _ are notes.",
    "Still guesses (not in the sheet): names whose meaning is unclear are left as the code (still to confirm:",
    "ECHO, AIR, MULTI, NEXT, CAD, RMA; TRANS, CO-NO and CO-YES were confirmed by PCFD); type_subtypes is",
    "empty (the sheet has no type -> subtype mapping); event_class, unit kinds/spoken names/spares/departments,",
    "received_via, the DISPATCH OTHER color, run cards, spoken phrases and geo_town_order."
